1
00:00:00,378 --> 00:00:02,078
(Amy:)I can't believe
you've been arrested.

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:05,110
(Sheldon:)I can't believe Penny hasn't.

3
00:00:06,184 --> 00:00:08,484
(Penny:)Sheldon, what did you do?

4
00:00:08,487 --> 00:00:10,017
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm not proud of it,

5
00:00:10,021 --> 00:00:12,521
(Sheldon:)but... I jaywalked.

6
00:00:12,524 --> 00:00:14,454
(Leonard:)Oh, no, it's like
a horror movie.

7
00:00:14,459 --> 00:00:17,529
(Leonard:)We're trapped in a cabin
with a maniac.

8
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:20,400
(Howard:)I'm surprised
you would do that.

9
00:00:20,398 --> 00:00:22,028
(Sheldon:)No, I crossed
in the middle of the street.

10
00:00:22,033 --> 00:00:23,403
(Sheldon:)And normally, I wouldn't,

11
00:00:23,401 --> 00:00:26,371
(Sheldon:)but I saw an aggressive-looking
Girl Scout,

12
00:00:26,371 --> 00:00:29,241
(Sheldon:)and it was the heart
of cookie season.

13
00:00:29,241 --> 00:00:31,671
(Sheldon:)Anyway, there was
a police officer,

14
00:00:31,676 --> 00:00:33,546
(Sheldon:)and he witnessed
the whole thing.

15
00:00:33,545 --> 00:00:35,245
(Penny:)What... he arrested you for that?

16
00:00:35,247 --> 00:00:36,617
(stammers)
No, he didn't do anything.

17
00:00:36,615 --> 00:00:37,985
(Sheldon:)So I said,
"You just saw me jaywalk.

18
00:00:37,983 --> 00:00:39,153
(Sheldon:)Why aren't you
doing your job?"

19
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:40,350
(Sheldon:)You know?

20
00:00:42,687 --> 00:00:44,087
"M-Maybe I should arrest you

21
00:00:44,089 --> 00:00:46,619
for-for impersonating
a police officer."

22
00:00:47,225 --> 00:00:49,055
(Penny:)And then you got arrested.

23
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,560
(Sheldon:)Oh, and how.

24
00:00:52,797 --> 00:00:56,237
(Howard:)I feel like I just made
a horrible mistake.

25
00:00:56,234 --> 00:00:57,564
(Bernadette:)Yeah.

26
00:00:57,569 --> 00:00:58,739
(Howard:)But on the other hand,

27
00:00:58,737 --> 00:01:00,207
(Howard:)I didn't kick him
out of our lives.

